PETSELFTEST1
# V4-07 motion games: the game menu, the tilt ball (seed 4242) and
# peekaboo. Tilt and face down/up are injected with "gesture" steps: this
# checks the board path, the tilt thresholds are host-tested
# (tests/cpp/test_motion_game.cc). Run outside the quiet hours (default
# 20:30-07:00) and above the low-battery level, or the Game item only says
# hi (PET_GAME_REFUSED). Motion must be on in the parent menu (default).
# Seed 4242 rolls the ball to holes at cell 6, 0 and 5 (start cell 3):
# three tilts right, three left, two right (checked in test_motion_game.cc).
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# Games are UI only: no pet commits.
# expect commits 0
# Menu three times: leave by long press; ball; peekaboo.
# expect min:PET_GAME_MENU 3
# expect min:PET_GAME_CHOICE 2
# expect min:src=motion 2
# expect min:end=home 1
# Ball: 3 + 3 + 2 rolls, a hole each round. The last roll of a round is
# logged as PET_MOTION_HOLE, not STEP: 2 + 2 + 1 steps.
# expect min:PET_MOTION_STEP 5
# expect min:PET_MOTION_HOLE 3
# Peekaboo: one flip back too early, then three finds (shaking in between
# is no reward).
# expect min:PET_MOTION_TOO_SOON 1
# expect min:PET_MOTION_HIDE 4
# expect min:PET_MOTION_FOUND 3
# expect min:end=completed 2
# expect min:growth=1 2
# expect none:PET_GAME_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_GAME_START_FAILED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
# The Game / Feed rail items refuse in the quiet hours (PET_GAME_REFUSED
# reason=quiet; Feed then falls back to V7 plain feed), so pin the day phase:
# the 2026-11-07 22:22 board run showed 3 plain feeds (241,242,242) here.
phase day
volume 15
# Start as soon as XiaoZhi is idle (Wi-Fi up, activated), not after a
# fixed 20 s; the pet toggle below still retries.
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Home rail: left end (Chat), then two to the right = Game.
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap up 800
tap down 800
tap down 2000
# Menu (full refresh into the game screen); a long press goes home.
game 4242
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 8000
# Menu again: Move page (card 2), its first card is the ball.
tap press 6000
tap down 1500
tap down 1500
tap press 3000
tap press 8000
# Ball round 1: hole at cell 6. Shaking and face down are no part of it.
gesture hard
wait 1000
gesture tiltright
wait 900
gesture tiltright
wait 900
gesture tiltright
wait 5500
# Round 2: hole at cell 0.
gesture tiltleft
wait 900
gesture tiltleft
wait 900
gesture tiltleft
wait 5500
# Round 3: hole at cell 5, then home (full refresh).
gesture tiltright
wait 900
gesture tiltright
wait 9000
# Peekaboo: the second card of the Move page.
# Flipping back after 0.6 s is too early.
tap press 6000
tap down 1500
tap down 1500
tap press 3000
tap down 1500
tap press 8000
gesture facedown
wait 600
gesture faceup
wait 3500
gesture facedown
wait 3500
gesture faceup
wait 5500
# Round 2: a hard shake is no reward, hiding is.
gesture hard
wait 1000
gesture facedown
wait 3500
gesture faceup
wait 5500
# Round 3, then home.
gesture facedown
wait 3500
gesture faceup
wait 9000
end
